    "Access to a different folder does not allow reading or saving this image’s sidecar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权访问其他文件夹并不能读取或保存此图像的附属文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds an equal offset to linear RGB before tone mapping. Negative values clip shadows; positive values lift black.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在色调映射前为线性 RGB 添加相同的偏移量。负值会裁切阴影，正值会抬高黑位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Contrast until the SDR image looks good, then choose Continue. The HDR extension updates automatically from the SDR curve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整对比度，直到 SDR 图像效果满意，然后点击“继续”。HDR 延伸部分会根据 SDR 曲线自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust white point when you release the Tone slider. The hidden HDR Target follows Tone and Contrast adjustments.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "松开影调滑块时调整白场。隐藏的 HDR 目标值会随影调和对比度更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
