    "Approximate outer gamut projections across all lightness levels. Outside indicates out of gamut; inside does not guarantee membership because this scope omits lightness.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有明度下的色域外轮廓近似投影。轮廓外表示超出色域；由于示波器未显示明度，轮廓内不一定属于该色域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
