      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低饱和度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lowers HDR white below the calculated target while preserving the starting tangent. Zero keeps a straight continuation; 100% ends flat. HDR Gain multiplies the result and can be increased if the curves cross.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在保留起始切线方向的同时，将 HDR 白色降至计算目标值以下。零为直线延伸，100% 时末端变平。HDR 增益会乘以整个结果；若曲线交叉，可增加增益。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Luminance → Saturation": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度 → 饱和度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Luminance Noise Reduction": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度降噪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LZW compression. HDR preserves the full rendition by scaling it down by HDR Gain to fit a standard SDR file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 LZW 压缩。HDR 版本按 HDR 输出亮度缩小数值范围，以标准 SDR 文件保留完整画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
